    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like \"upgrades\" is a pretty nice way of putting it lol. but honestly, for a small shop, those upgrades can cost a fortune. is there actually any data on whether these regulations are worth the hit to small businesses, or are we just supposed to accept the costs because it's better for the environment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
